      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sales - attentive, came to site several times, prepared to negotiate price, has been in touch since installation. Note also got quote from TruEnergy - cheapest, but didn't visit site and refused to itemise quote.Design - excellent though panels had to be installed \"landscape\" because roof battens were incorrectly spaced.Installation - very professional, thorough, safety conscious, good problem solver, committed to green energy.Follow up - not so good; Energy Australia and Powercor asking for forms which they no longer use OR are headed differently. Being told that final tweaking of Smart Meter might take 6 weeks.",
