    {
      "review_id": "14909",
      "reviewer_name": "Rhonda",
      "reviewer_location": "VIC - 3029",
      "reviewer_state": "VIC",
      "reviewer_postcode": "3029",
      "reviewer_postcode_valid": true,
      "review_date": "2012-07-24",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "So far so good.  Took longer than expected for installation.  After speaking to Caitlyn at hand, office discovered they'd had a few problems with installers and very busy demand.  Each time a asked for something in writing she was only too pleased to accommodate.  Ordered system on 29/5/12 and had it installed today 24/7/12, so about 2 months.  Guys who came out to install arrived when they said they would and were also very pleasant.  I had two systems installed, one for myself and one for my parents, across the road.Shine On (or Homegreen, as they were when we originally signed with them) were not the cheapest, and neither were they the most expensive.  The reason we went with them was probably having the sales person arrange to come out straight away to give a quote and not just to it by email or over the phone. He was very professional and friendly.Now, let's see how long it takes to get on the grid and for it all to be working.",
